  day: 3
  text: "I\u2019ve got something interesting to tell you. B3. The mineshaft that
    started it all. Your predecessor got fired because of it. It is the richest cave
    out of all of them, but F11 refused to send anyone there, and as such she failed
    to meet the quota. You can see for yourself what happens to you if that happens.
    Just take a long, hard look at the creature \u201CEmma\u201D that you send to
    the mines."
